Ahlan Social — Account Deletion

How to Delete Your Account

Ahlan Social users do not need to submit a separate account deletion request. You can permanently delete your account directly from within the app.

Steps to delete your account:

1. Open Ahlan Social.
2. Go to Settings.
3. Select Delete Account and confirm your decision.

What Happens When You Delete Your Account?

When you confirm account deletion, all your account data is immediately deleted from our database, without exception.

This includes your profile information, posts, photos, stories, messages, and other data associated with your account.

Account deletion is permanent and cannot be undone.

